OL,16,     FWhen Classics professor Daniel
OL,17,     FMendelsohn let his outspoken dad
OL,18,     Fsit in on his class about the
OL,19,     FOdyssey, a story he'd taught for
OL,20,     Fyears began to mirror their own
OL,21,     Fcomplex relationship.
